{{!
    @template local_aicoursebuilder/blueprint_tree

    The parts of the course, one under another and indented by how deep they are: sections, subsections, activities
    and the questions of a quiz. Choosing one opens it for editing.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * nodes - The parts of the course, each with:
        * id - The id of the part
        * label - Its title or name
        * kind - What it is: section, subsection, activity or question
        * type - The type of an activity or question, empty for a section
        * indent - How far to indent it, 0 to 5
        * flagged - Whether the generation marked it for a human to check
        * selected - Whether it is the part being edited
        * invalid - Whether the validator found something in it

    Example context (json):
    {
        "nodes": [
            {"id": "s1", "label": "Introduction", "kind": "section", "type": "", "indent": 0, "flagged": false,
             "selected": true, "invalid": false},
            {"id": "s1.page1", "label": "What is energy", "kind": "activity", "type": "page", "indent": 2,
             "flagged": true, "selected": false, "invalid": false}
        ]
    }
}}
<ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" data-region="aicb-tree-list">
    {{#nodes}}
        <li class="pl-{{indent}} mb-1 d-flex align-items-center">
            <button type="button"
                    class="btn btn-link text-left p-0 {{#selected}}font-weight-bold{{/selected}}"
                    data-action="aicb-select" data-id="{{id}}"
                    {{#selected}}aria-current="true"{{/selected}}>
                {{label}}
            </button>
            {{#type}}<span class="badge badge-light ml-2">{{type}}</span>{{/type}}
            {{#flagged}}
                <span class="badge badge-warning ml-2" data-region="aicb-flag">{{#str}} editor:needscheck, local_aicoursebuilder {{/str}}</span>
            {{/flagged}}
            {{#invalid}}
                <span class="badge badge-danger ml-2">{{#str}} editor:invalid, local_aicoursebuilder {{/str}}</span>
            {{/invalid}}
        </li>
    {{/nodes}}
</ul>
